1d:["$","section","1-Why the first-month cash requirement matters",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why the first-month cash requirement matters"}],[["$","p","Annual affordability does not guarantee that the first month is manageable. Housing deposits, initial rent, travel, residence procedures and daily costs can arrive before any scholarship payment.",{"children":"Annual affordability does not guarantee that the first month is manageable. Housing deposits, initial rent, travel, residence procedures and daily costs can arrive before any scholarship payment."}],["$","p","Keep a separate arrival target and verify when each scholarship instalment is expected. Do not rely on unconfirmed part-time employment to fund the visa or first weeks.",{"children":"Keep a separate arrival target and verify when each scholarship instalment is expected. Do not rely on unconfirmed part-time employment to fund the visa or first weeks."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
